# Feature Architecture & File Layout

## Strategic Purpose
Enterprise recruiting / analytics / NCAA compliance platform for 2026: $20.5M revenue-share cap, 105-man rosters, NIL collectives. Unifies verified telemetry, AI film, sports IQ, and FinTech escrow in a multi-tenant command center for HS/JUCO athletes, college coaches, and compliance officers.

## Core Modules (canonical filenames)
| Domain | Modules |
|---|---|
| Command Center | `GridironGatewayDashboard` — directory, dossier, NIL estimator |
| Recruit profile | `OnboardingWizard`, `AthleteProfileCard` |
| Rankings / portal | `LeaderboardTop250`, `TransferPortalModule` |
| Coach ops | `CoachPipelineBoard`, `CoachWorkspace`, `RecruitingPipeline` |
| Academics / AI | `NcaaEligibilityTracker`, `AIRecruitingAssistant` |
| Front office | `CapGMRosterSimulator`, RallySafe, MultiTenant RBAC |
| Scouting | `BioScanTelemetryModule`, `TrueSpeedModule`, Cognition, Combine Laser (P4), Autonomous Scouting (P4) |
| Film / consent | `AiFilmTaggingStudio` / `AIFilmStudio`, `ParentConsentPortal` (P4) |

## Canonical Paths
- Types: `src/types.ts` (`AthleteProfile`, `PipelineOffer`, `CapGmPlayer`, `BioScanTelemetry`, `MultiTenantUser`, etc.)
- SPA root / RBAC state: `src/App.tsx`
- Live clients: `src/services/*`, `src/lib/supabaseClient.ts`
- Cap math tests: `src/capGmTestSuite.ts`
- Mock fixtures (not product DB): `src/data/mockData.ts`
- Master shell: `src/components/GridironGatewayDashboard.tsx`
- Backend: `server.ts` (REST RallySafe/Laser + WS BioScan)

## Product Guide Source of Truth
`README.md` + `docs/dashboard-spec.md` + `.cursor/rules/federov.mdc`. Prefer extending named modules over inventing parallel files. Prefer verified/instrumented metrics, fail-closed compliance, integer-cents FinTech, RBAC persona isolation, and the lime/red/gold/sky/maroon/orange sports-tech palette.
